{
  "README.md": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "# Museum accession notes"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "This desk edits persistent records and accepts archive receipts. The host injects"
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "store, timers, archive and rendering services. Public calls open(id), edit(text),"
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "close(), submit() and dispose() are synchronous. Renderers are output sinks and"
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "never reenter. Store delivery may call workspace integrations inline; the latest"
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "navigation request by start order is the host's selection. Adjacent preview uses"
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "its own trailing utility and can be hidden or reused. See docs/host-api.md and"
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "the source implementations for the service APIs."
    }
  ],
  "docs/host-api.md": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "# Host API"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "Store read/write/subscribe are synchronous. Records are written before inline"
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "delivery; removed subscriptions are skipped. onSaved may call navigation or edit."
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "Rendering a save event is tied to the mounted subscription; close/open retires"
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "that subscription immediately. Departed text is readable when navigation returns."
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "Each opening is a fresh visit, even when its record key is the same."
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "Archive capture/list copy document and text values; these sinks never navigate."
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "A submit accepts its selected record and text at entry, returns one immutable"
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "receipt, and the store already contains that text when capture is called. No"
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "selection returns null. Later navigation does not undo acceptance. Visible"
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "feedback belongs to its original visit; navigation clears it, and uninterrupted"
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "acceptance displays it. This API is also used after edits continue."
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "Timers schedule(callback, delay) and cancel(handle) are injected by the host."
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "Cancellation discards a pending preview query. Preview publishes at a 40 ms"
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "quiet interval; hide discards unpublished work and subsequent reuse is supported."
    }
  ],
